          "rationale": "Detail freshness is unknown; this asks for clarification or a bounded proposed change."
        },
        {
          "path": "/content/changeType",
          "kind": "derived",
          "inputRefs": [
            "art_rb157_current_inspection@1",
            "art_rb157_dispatch_task@1"
          ]
        },
        {
          "path": "/content/request",
          "kind": "hypothesis",
          "rationale": "A detail-level guarantee could resolve the task's pre-assignment uncertainty; an existing implementation may make a new endpoint unnecessary.",
          "evidenceRefs": [
            "art_rb157_current_inspection@1#/content/description",
            "art_rb157_dispatch_task@1#/content/tasks/0"
          ]
        },
        {
          "path": "/content/rationale",
          "kind": "derived",
          "inputRefs": [
            "art_rb157_dispatch_task@1",
            "art_rb157_current_inspection@1"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "content": {
        "summary": "Proposed, conditional upstream request: establish whether the detail view can verify the selected work order's severity, age, and assignment immediately before crew assignment. No such refresh or freshness guarantee is evidenced in the constructed inventory.",
        "changeType": "capability",
        "request": "For an exact work-order ID, document and expose the detail read's severity, age, assigned crew, update time, and relevant error/authorization behavior before crew assignment. If the existing detail already provides these, supply evidence and semantics instead of adding a new endpoint. If it does not, propose the smallest read or freshness mechanism; no comparison or bulk-assignment API is requested.",
        "rationale": "The task requires inspecting severity and age for the same ID before assignment, while the only evidenced fields are on a synthetic list response. Echoing list values in detail could be stale, especially age. A detail-level freshness contract would resolve whether the proposed UI may present these values as current. This is a hypothesis requiring upstream review, not an implemented capability or blocker to provisional UI exploration."
      }
    }
  ],
